#: ../../changelog/firmware/v3.9.3.rst:4
msgid "v3.9.3"
msgstr "v3.9.3"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v3.9.3.rst:6
msgid ""
"v3.9.3 is a networking-and-stability release: it adds the **Bormio** board "
"and Portenta WiFi examples, updates LWIP, makes the PLL clock source "
"configurable, and fixes a batch of CYW43/LWIP, soft-reset, SDIO, MQTT, FLIR "
"Lepton, and TV bugs. It introduces **no breaking API changes** — v3.9.2 "
"scripts run unchanged."
msgstr ""
"v3.9.3 je izdanje usmjereno na umrežavanje i stabilnost: dodaje ploču "
"**Bormio** i primjere za Portenta WiFi, ažurira LWIP, čini izvor takta PLL-a"
" podesivim te ispravlja niz pogrešaka u CYW43/LWIP, mekom resetu, SDIO, "
"MQTT, FLIR Lepton i TV-u. Ne uvodi **nikakve promjene API-ja koje narušavaju"
" kompatibilnost** — skripte za v3.9.2 rade nepromijenjene."

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v3.9.3.rst:15
msgid "On this page"
msgstr "Na ovoj stranici"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v3.9.3.rst:18
msgid "Highlights"
msgstr "Istaknuto"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v3.9.3.rst:20
msgid "**Bormio** board support."
msgstr "Podrška za ploču **Bormio**\\ ."

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v3.9.3.rst:21
#: ../../changelog/firmware/v3.9.3.rst:30
msgid "**Portenta WiFi examples** added."
msgstr "Dodani su **primjeri za Portenta WiFi**\\ ."

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v3.9.3.rst:22
msgid ""
"**More reliable networking** — CYW43/LWIP and soft-reset fixes, a connect "
"timeout, and updated LWIP."
msgstr ""
"**Pouzdanije umrežavanje** — ispravci za CYW43/LWIP i meki reset, istek "
"vremena za povezivanje te ažurirani LWIP."

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v3.9.3.rst:24
msgid ""
"**No breaking API changes** — reflash and your v3.9.2 scripts run unchanged."
msgstr ""
"**Nikakve promjene API-ja koje narušavaju kompatibilnost** — ponovno "
"isprogramirajte i vaše skripte za v3.9.2 rade nepromijenjene."

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v3.9.3.rst:28
msgid "New features"
msgstr "Nove značajke"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v3.9.3.rst:31
msgid ""
"The PLL clock source is now configurable, and flags were added to reserve "
"DMA streams."
msgstr ""
"Izvor takta PLL-a sada je podesiv, a dodane su i zastavice za rezerviranje "
"DMA tokova."

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v3.9.3.rst:35
msgid "Other changes and improvements"
msgstr "Ostale promjene i poboljšanja"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v3.9.3.rst:37
msgid ""
"Updated LWIP to the latest release; added a connection timeout to the CYW43 "
"``connect()``; call ``gc_sweep_all`` on soft-reset to reclaim memory."
msgstr ""
"Ažuriran LWIP na najnovije izdanje; dodan istek vremena povezivanja u CYW43 "
"``connect()``\\ ; pozivanje ``gc_sweep_all`` pri mekom resetu radi "
"oslobađanja memorije."

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v3.9.3.rst:41
msgid "Bug fixes"
msgstr "Ispravci pogrešaka"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v3.9.3.rst:43
msgid "Networking:"
msgstr "Umrežavanje:"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v3.9.3.rst:45
msgid ""
"Fixed CYW43/LWIP and soft-reset bugs, used temporary DMA buffers for SDIO "
"transfers, and made the MQTT library handle a ``None`` return from "
"``recv()``."
msgstr ""
"Ispravljene pogreške u CYW43/LWIP i mekom resetu, korišteni privremeni DMA "
"međuspremnici za SDIO prijenose te osposobljena MQTT biblioteka da obrađuje "
"``None`` povratnu vrijednost iz ``recv()``\\ ."

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v3.9.3.rst:49
msgid "Camera and display:"
msgstr "Kamera i zaslon:"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v3.9.3.rst:51
msgid ""
"Updated the FLIR Lepton driver and fixed the RGB channel order for TV "
"output."
msgstr ""
"Ažuriran upravljački program za FLIR Lepton i ispravljen redoslijed RGB "
"kanala za TV izlaz."

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v3.9.3.rst:54
msgid "System:"
msgstr "Sustav:"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v3.9.3.rst:56
msgid "Ensured PendSV is not masked before stopping/executing a script."
msgstr ""
"Osigurano da PendSV nije maskiran prije zaustavljanja/izvršavanja skripte."

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v3.9.3.rst:59
msgid "Hardware and board support"
msgstr "Hardver i podrška za ploče"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v3.9.3.rst:61
msgid "**Bormio** — new board."
msgstr "**Bormio** — nova ploča."

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v3.9.3.rst:64
msgid "Breaking API changes"
msgstr "Promjene API-ja koje narušavaju kompatibilnost"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v3.9.3.rst:66
msgid ""
"v3.9.3 introduces **no breaking Python API changes**. Scripts that ran on "
"v3.9.2 run unchanged on v3.9.3 — just reflash the firmware."
msgstr ""
"v3.9.3 ne uvodi **nikakve promjene Python API-ja koje narušavaju "
"kompatibilnost**\\ . Skripte koje su radile na v3.9.2 rade nepromijenjene na"
" v3.9.3 — samo ponovno isprogramirajte ugrađeni program (firmware)."
